# Schedules for the optional compose `scheduler` service (supercronic). Same defaults as the
# Helm chart's CronJobs, in UTC (the image sets no TZ). k8s ignores this file: it uses CronJobs.
#
# dispatch decides per target whether a run is due; this only sets how often it checks.
*/15 * * * * invenio-testrig-dashboard dispatch
# results within ~2 minutes of a run ending, plus the live progress of running runs.
*/2 * * * * invenio-testrig-dashboard ingest
# Postgres backup to s3_backup_bucket (its own bucket), as the chart's backup.schedule.
0 3 * * * invenio-testrig-dashboard backup
